<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - World Color. [CORRECTED 00:43 GMT 13/12]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - World Color. [CORRECTED 00:43 GMT 13/12]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of World Color Press Inc with an attractive rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>(Corrects brokerage from PaineWebber).</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-1/2 at 21-1/8.</p>
</text>
